This is a non-official, non-commercially distributed student extension of
hithesis/hithesis, maintained by queekye.

1. The unchanged upstream hithesis.dtx and hithesis.ins retain their original
   copyright notices and LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL), version 1.3a or
   any later version.
2. The upstream README also states Creative Commons Attribution-
   NonCommercial 4.0 (CC BY-NC 4.0) for the project Files/Codes. That notice is
   retained in UPSTREAM-README.md. This distribution conservatively retains
   it; it does not remove the upstream notice or grant commercial permission.
3. The separately named student class/packages and added scripts/documentation
   are maintained modifications by queekye, distributed under LPPL 1.3a or
   later together with CC BY-NC 4.0.
4. student/gbt7714-numerical-quanjiao.bst additionally retains Zeping Lee's
   copyright and LPPL 1.3c or later notice; see its header for the full lineage.

The original work remains available at https://github.com/hithesis/hithesis .
The exact baseline and all maintained adaptations are documented in
FORK-NOTES.md and CHANGES.md. This project has no university certification.

